WEBVTT

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.430
Is that the town of Korin?!

00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:59.003
Yes, it is a town built
on information trade

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.973
where any information can
be bought and sold.

00:02:02.266 --> 00:02:04.466
What is "information trade"?

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.070
It's all about money.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.500
In this town, you can find out
anything you want for a price.

00:02:10.766 --> 00:02:13.226
In this town, there are all kinds
of master informants.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:18.073
But the greatest of them all
has to be Homeron.

00:02:18.466 --> 00:02:21.496
Yes, I've heard that name too.

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:24.496
It's a rather delicious
sounding name, maro.

00:02:24.566 --> 00:02:26.026
I'm hungry, maro.

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.926
It's not food!

00:02:44.233 --> 00:02:45.533
Hey, Shu! Let's go!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.170
Uh, yeah...

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:56.933
HOMERON HAS DIED

00:02:57.566 --> 00:02:59.566
Right this way for a great deal
on information!

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:00.970
Wow...

00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:03.496
These are all master
informants' shops?

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.870
How are we going to find

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.870
this master informant
named Homeron like this?

00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:10.833
Welcome, welcome.

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:13.803
Master Homeron's shop is this way!

00:03:15.366 --> 00:03:17.326
This is the shop of Master Homeron,

00:03:17.366 --> 00:03:19.466
the greatest master informant
in the world!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:22.730
It's quite different from
what I imagined.

00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:26.073
I didn't think it would be so flashy.

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:28.226
"Master Informant Homeron."

00:03:28.966 --> 00:03:30.896
That's what it says right here...

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:34.103
I wonder if this really is the place?

00:03:34.466 --> 00:03:38.226
Say, Miss...
Is Homeron really here?

00:03:38.566 --> 00:03:40.066
Yes, of course.

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:41.203
Ah...

00:03:42.366 --> 00:03:43.666
My name is Legalas.

00:03:43.966 --> 00:03:46.696
Under orders of the most gracious
King of Jibralâ€”

00:03:46.733 --> 00:03:48.973
We would like to ask Homeron
to do a job for us.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.030
I will let him know right away!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.700
Ignoring me again?!

00:03:55.733 --> 00:03:57.873
And what is your business?

00:03:58.566 --> 00:04:00.666
We want you to find
a certain woman.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.600
A woman, you say?

00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:06.103
She's in her 20s or 30s,
she has blue eyes

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:09.773
and wears a perfume that smells
like some kind of flower.

00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:12.196
I am not a fortuneteller.

00:04:12.966 --> 00:04:14.796
There's no way I could
tell her whereabouts

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:16.133
by that information alone.

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:20.033
She disappeared from Jibral Castle.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.300
You could pick up and follow
her trail from there, couldn't you?

00:04:22.733 --> 00:04:24.273
Jibral Castle, you say?!

00:04:24.866 --> 00:04:29.196
That makes it even more difficult.

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:30.473
What do you mean?!

00:04:30.766 --> 00:04:33.466
You better think before
you speak ill of my land!

00:04:34.066 --> 00:04:36.226
You don't know?

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.270
Huh?

00:04:37.433 --> 00:04:39.573
Has something happened
to Jibral Castle?

00:04:39.733 --> 00:04:43.273
Hmmm, let's see...
That will cost you 20 gold.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:44.530
Yes!

00:04:46.966 --> 00:04:49.966
That'll be 20 gold
for the information.

00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:53.033
Good grief, is everything
about money here?

00:04:53.733 --> 00:04:54.403
Here.

00:04:54.566 --> 00:04:55.226
Thank you!

00:04:56.733 --> 00:05:00.933
Jibral Castle disappeared without
a trace the other day.

00:05:03.866 --> 00:05:05.996
Give me back my money, you!

00:05:06.966 --> 00:05:09.666
Who would pay money for
such false information!

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:11.533
It's not false!

00:05:12.066 --> 00:05:13.196
Whaâ€”?

00:05:13.766 --> 00:05:15.926
Jibral Castle no longer exists.

00:05:16.533 --> 00:05:19.233
It's as if the entire country
has vanished completely.

00:05:20.033 --> 00:05:21.303
Jibral Castle...?!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:23.970
Well, what happened to His Majesty?

00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.133
What happened to the King?

00:05:26.766 --> 00:05:28.266
I do not know.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.400
Why did Jibral Castle disappear?

00:05:31.666 --> 00:05:32.826
That is being investigated.

00:05:33.533 --> 00:05:34.203
You're lying!

00:05:34.933 --> 00:05:37.433
Even if Jibral was defeated
by the Grankingdom,

00:05:37.466 --> 00:05:40.296
it has its allied nations
behind them.

00:05:41.066 --> 00:05:45.226
Don't expect the great Legalas
to believe such a wild tale!

00:05:45.433 --> 00:05:46.933
Old man...

00:05:47.433 --> 00:05:49.333
I'll have to see it with
my own eyes to believe it!

00:05:49.366 --> 00:05:50.366
Legalas!

00:05:50.633 --> 00:05:51.673
Let him go.

00:05:52.866 --> 00:05:54.026
I wonder if he'll be okay...

00:05:54.533 --> 00:05:57.673
He probably won't accept it
unless he sees it himself.

00:05:58.266 --> 00:06:01.096
So, what we just heard was true?

00:06:01.266 --> 00:06:02.296
It's true!

00:06:03.166 --> 00:06:05.796
Master informants only sell the truth!

00:06:06.233 --> 00:06:08.633
Then, is everyone gone, maro...?

00:06:08.866 --> 00:06:12.196
The Castle disappeared overnight,

00:06:12.233 --> 00:06:15.403
as if it had been blown away
in an instant.

00:06:16.233 --> 00:06:17.233
It's Nene.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:19.900
It was Nene's doing!

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:20.970
Shu...

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.170
This is no time for us
to be hesitating like this!

00:06:24.766 --> 00:06:25.996
Calm down, Shu.

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:28.803
We have to take one step
at a time.

00:06:29.266 --> 00:06:31.596
Otherwise, we'll make
the same mistakes.

00:06:33.633 --> 00:06:34.303
Now...

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.370
Are you willing to undertake
our job?

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:41.170
It would be extremely difficult
to find that woman.

00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:45.026
Let's see, I'd need
5,000 gold up front,

00:06:45.066 --> 00:06:48.066
and then another 5,000
when the job is finished.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.370
Of course, that doesn't
include expenses.

00:06:50.466 --> 00:06:52.366
You're really greedy, maro.

00:06:52.933 --> 00:06:54.703
I will prepare 20,000 gold.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.030
T-Twenty thousand, you say?
Really?

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.200
Yes.

00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:01.003
Seriously?!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.830
- I'll do it!
- Me!

00:07:02.866 --> 00:07:03.526
No, me!

00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:05.626
Hey, you guys! This is my job!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:11.330
Who're you guys?
We are talking to Homeron!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.330
We are Homeron, too.

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:14.703
Huh?!

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:16.073
What does that mean?

00:07:16.366 --> 00:07:18.126
I am Homeron the Second.

00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:19.733
And I'm Homeron the Legitimate.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.870
I am Homeron Junior.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.370
I am the Original Homeron.

00:07:24.766 --> 00:07:25.766
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.400
So many Homerons, maro.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.600
Is there plain Homeron?

00:07:29.966 --> 00:07:30.626
No, there isn't.

00:07:32.366 --> 00:07:33.926
Homeron is dead.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.500
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.470
What does it say there, maro?

00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:48.233
It says that master informant
Homeron died in battle,

00:07:48.266 --> 00:07:51.826
and with his passing a great deal
of information was lost.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.200
It also says that Homeron
did not want to die.

00:07:55.633 --> 00:07:57.233
So, how did he die?

00:07:57.766 --> 00:08:01.926
There was a big battle within
the Grankingdom, right?

00:08:02.533 --> 00:08:06.273
Homeron enlisted as a scout to
gather information about the enemy.

00:08:06.933 --> 00:08:07.973
I heard that he was in a unit

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.300
under the direct command of
Knight Master Conrad himself.

00:08:10.666 --> 00:08:11.766
Under Conrad's...?

00:08:12.533 --> 00:08:17.033
The allies of Jibral fought valiantly,
but Grankingdom won.

00:08:17.633 --> 00:08:19.103
And many lost their lives.

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:21.933
In other words,
he was killed in action.

00:08:22.466 --> 00:08:23.726
Yes, as you can see...

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.370
What happened to Conrad?

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:31.100
That will be 2,000 gold...
Or that's what I'd like to say.

00:08:31.366 --> 00:08:33.026
But the truth is that
no one seems to know.

00:08:33.466 --> 00:08:36.496
Listen, our master informants
are not bad at all.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:37.570
No?

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:40.070
There's no deal if your informant
is just an imposter.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.870
I didn't know you had
so much money, Zola.

00:08:45.266 --> 00:08:46.866
Offering to pay 2,000 gold.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.500
There's no way
she has that much money.

00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:52.033
Then how do we hire
a master informant?

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.730
I'll come up with it.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.300
I'm told this town has
a bulletin board with job listings.

00:08:57.766 --> 00:09:00.596
Then, you should go to
the plaza with the fountain.

00:09:04.266 --> 00:09:06.866
Five hundred gold for
a mantanta fish.

00:09:07.833 --> 00:09:12.303
Five thousand in gold for bringing
in just one Gaigaurus horn!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.200
There're a lot of ads for jobs.

00:09:15.433 --> 00:09:17.633
If we all join forces,

00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:20.666
we should be able to raise
20,000 gold by noon tomorrow.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.200
Kluke and Bouquet,
you two go find

00:09:23.233 --> 00:09:25.433
another master informant
to replace Homeron.

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:26.503
- Right.
- Right.

00:09:26.533 --> 00:09:29.473
I would ask that you please
choose one of our masters.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.770
You're persistent, maro.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:31.800
You are still here...?

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.200
As an assistant,

00:09:33.233 --> 00:09:36.533
if the masters don't earn money,
then I'm in trouble too.

00:09:36.566 --> 00:09:39.566
Say, where can we find
this Gaigaurus?

00:09:39.966 --> 00:09:43.266
By the way, I don't have any money.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:46.900
Look, why don't you just ask
the person who posted the ad?

00:09:47.266 --> 00:09:48.866
There's the name on the bottom.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.630
Got it! Thank you.

00:09:50.733 --> 00:09:52.003
Oh, wait a minute!

00:09:52.933 --> 00:09:55.703
The Gaigaurus is
an incredibly powerful monster.

00:09:56.066 --> 00:09:58.766
I don't even know if a Knight Master
could defeat one.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.730
That powerful?!

00:10:01.033 --> 00:10:04.973
Yes, I hear nobody has ever returned
alive from confronting Gaigaurus.

00:10:05.466 --> 00:10:09.266
All right! Now I'm really fired up!
I'll be back!

00:10:09.466 --> 00:10:12.296
Hey, someone should stop
that kid!

00:10:12.733 --> 00:10:13.903
Impossible.

00:10:14.133 --> 00:10:16.673
Once his mind's made up,
he won't listen, maro!

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.430
Yeah. He's been like
that since long ago.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.370
But that's the great thing
about him too.

00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:23.426
All right. I'm counting on you.

00:10:24.933 --> 00:10:29.003
I'm going fishing too, maro.
We'll all go together, maro!

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:35.233
The scent...of flowers...

00:10:44.033 --> 00:10:46.073
Let's see... Is this the place?

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.070
Welcome!

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.370
Uh, you again?
We have no business with you.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.470
I also work here part time.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.530
Hey, you're not serious about
going after a Gaigaurus, are you?

00:10:58.700 --> 00:10:59.370
Yeah, I am!

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:03.473
If it's stronger than a Knight Master,
then it will be a worthy opponent.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.870
I wanna become much,
much stronger!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.200
Why?

00:11:08.566 --> 00:11:09.926
To defeat Nene.

00:11:10.566 --> 00:11:11.566
Defeat Nene...?

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:12.870
This way...

00:11:14.466 --> 00:11:15.466
Come with me.

00:11:18.566 --> 00:11:22.166
A Gaigaurus has made its lair
in the cave behind this waterfall.

00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:26.133
It's been eating up all the fish
and animals in the area,

00:11:26.166 --> 00:11:27.896
and the people nearby
are struggling.

00:11:30.433 --> 00:11:31.103
Say...

00:11:31.433 --> 00:11:33.273
You were talking about
defeating Nene,

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:34.670
but you must know
that's impossible, right?

00:11:36.466 --> 00:11:38.026
Why do you say that?

00:11:39.333 --> 00:11:43.273
Because even the descendants of
the Soldiers of Light couldn't stop him.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.170
That's not information;
it's just a rumor...

00:11:48.866 --> 00:11:51.826
They say the reincarnations
of the Soldiers of Light

00:11:51.866 --> 00:11:54.496
mentioned in the Book
of the Beginning

00:11:54.533 --> 00:11:57.733
stormed Nene's castle
to defeat him.

00:11:58.733 --> 00:12:01.503
But they lost to Nene.

00:12:02.366 --> 00:12:05.066
They say the descendants
all perished.

00:12:06.933 --> 00:12:09.233
There is no way that someone
like you could win against Nene.

00:12:09.266 --> 00:12:11.166
Even the Soldiers of Light
couldn't win against him.

00:12:11.633 --> 00:12:12.973
You should just give it up
and go home.

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:14.866
They didn't perish!

00:12:15.366 --> 00:12:16.026
Huh?

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.830
The Soldiers of Light's descendants...

00:12:19.033 --> 00:12:20.533
They're not dead yet.

00:12:38.966 --> 00:12:39.966
It's deep.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.600
It is. But your Shadow can
get to the bottom.

00:12:43.533 --> 00:12:44.703
Hey, Jiro.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.670
What do you want me to do
at a place like this?

00:12:48.433 --> 00:12:49.503
We're going fishing.

00:12:50.166 --> 00:12:53.996
The mantanta is a fish that lives
only at the bottom of this lake.

00:12:54.433 --> 00:12:58.633
Don't tell me you're using me
as a fishing pole...

00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:00.466
Follow Killer Bat.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.300
Good Grief!

00:13:12.733 --> 00:13:14.133
So this is a mantanta, huh?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.700
If you catch 40 of them,
we can earn 20,000.

00:13:17.933 --> 00:13:19.733
We're not done yet?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.870
We need money in order for us
to get stronger.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.300
Fine, then catch this!

00:13:25.833 --> 00:13:26.503
Whaâ€”?!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:32.770
This is the place.

00:13:34.066 --> 00:13:35.826
This is where the Gaigaurus lives?

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.300
If you want to run,
you'd better do it now.

00:13:39.366 --> 00:13:40.566
I don't run away!

00:13:43.266 --> 00:13:45.026
Well... I'm out of here!

00:14:01.133 --> 00:14:02.633
Here we go! Blue Dragon!

00:14:03.066 --> 00:14:04.966
Hey, isn't that a Gaigaurus?!

00:14:06.833 --> 00:14:09.303
You really think you can take it down?

00:14:09.333 --> 00:14:12.473
Of course.
We have to win!

00:14:23.366 --> 00:14:24.366
Blue Dragon!

00:14:32.766 --> 00:14:33.766
I'm tired.

00:14:34.766 --> 00:14:38.166
I was hoping that Shu and I could
get a suite together.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.270
Hey you...

00:14:39.733 --> 00:14:41.603
I wonder if my darling is okay.

00:14:42.233 --> 00:14:44.673
I mean, if somebody is willing
to pay 5,000 for one horn,

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.600
then they must be pretty hard to get!

00:14:46.933 --> 00:14:48.603
That Gai...whatever its name is.

00:14:48.933 --> 00:14:52.073
He has his Blue Dragon.
He'll be fine.

00:14:52.533 --> 00:14:54.303
But enough of that!
Just get out already!

00:14:54.633 --> 00:14:58.273
We still have to find the best
master informant in this town.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.030
Toughen up, Shu! Or we're done for!

00:15:13.166 --> 00:15:15.226
Crushing Nail!

00:15:21.566 --> 00:15:22.566
We did it!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.570
If we can't defeat this thing,
we'll never beat Nene.

00:15:57.866 --> 00:15:59.926
You know that, don't you,
Blue Dragon?!

00:16:00.366 --> 00:16:03.866
We need to get stronger!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.100
If you know that,

00:16:07.133 --> 00:16:10.073
then don't let me have a hard time
against something like this!

00:16:10.566 --> 00:16:13.126
So come on and
turn on the juice, Shu!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.470
Special Technique, Fire Crisis!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.800
We did it...

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.070
Why not show that much
power all the time.

00:16:53.366 --> 00:16:54.866
Here's 10,000 gold.

00:16:55.266 --> 00:16:55.926
Thank you!

00:16:56.866 --> 00:16:58.996
So, you are a Shadow Wielder, huh?

00:16:59.533 --> 00:17:01.503
There's more to you
than meets the eye!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:02.600
Aw, it's nothing.

00:17:07.433 --> 00:17:09.533
What's wrong with
those children?

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.600
They're orphans who lost their parents
in the war against Nene.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:14.770
Huh?

00:17:15.466 --> 00:17:22.266
They often ask me where
their parents are.

00:17:23.433 --> 00:17:24.733
It isn't just them.
Many people come to Korin

00:17:25.166 --> 00:17:27.866
Many people come to Korin
searching for

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.170
the whereabouts of
their missing sons or husbands.

00:17:31.866 --> 00:17:34.626
They seem to be struggling
without money.

00:17:37.433 --> 00:17:39.633
Give this money
to those children!

00:17:39.966 --> 00:17:43.426
What? But I thought you needed this
to hire a master informant.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.800
Zola and the others
will come up with it.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.500
But...

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:50.433
It's okay.
Because I'm stronger now.

00:17:51.766 --> 00:17:53.126
I heard another rumor...

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.700
The reincarnations of
the Soldiers of Light

00:17:57.733 --> 00:17:59.373
may be Shadow Wielders.

00:18:02.466 --> 00:18:03.566
Yes, I see...

00:18:03.733 --> 00:18:06.473
So you want me to search
for that woman.

00:18:07.033 --> 00:18:08.373
I have 20,000.

00:18:09.066 --> 00:18:09.726
Eh?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.430
But before I hand over
this large amount of money,

00:18:15.466 --> 00:18:17.926
I'd like to test your skills.

00:18:18.633 --> 00:18:20.303
When Homeron died,

00:18:20.333 --> 00:18:23.233
I became the world's greatest
master informant.

00:18:24.766 --> 00:18:27.166
Then, tell me.
How did Homeron die?

00:18:27.466 --> 00:18:31.796
You saw his grave, didn't you?
He died fighting the Grankingdom.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.030
Did you obtain that
information yourself?

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:37.533
N-No I didn't, but...

00:18:38.033 --> 00:18:40.933
Well, then how can you be sure
that Homeron has actually died?

00:18:41.833 --> 00:18:43.233
We've heard that Homeron
is no more,

00:18:43.266 --> 00:18:46.396
but who delivered that information?

00:18:47.366 --> 00:18:51.696
Whoever brought it would be
the greatest master informant in town, right?

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:01.230
The master informant
we found didn't work out, huh?

00:19:01.666 --> 00:19:02.996
We'll have to keep searching.

00:19:04.333 --> 00:19:05.403
Where are you going, Zola?

00:19:06.733 --> 00:19:07.873
To Homeron's grave.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.770
Something about
this isn't adding up...

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.100
What do you think you're doing?

00:19:20.633 --> 00:19:25.803
A gigantic Flying Fortress sprang out
of Nene's Lair in Grankingdom.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.530
Then beams of light came
streaming out of the fortress.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.570
And in the next instant,
Jibral Castle had disappeared.

00:19:33.133 --> 00:19:34.333
So it was Nene after all...

00:19:35.233 --> 00:19:36.673
We were powerless.

00:19:37.633 --> 00:19:40.433
We are known as master informants,

00:19:40.466 --> 00:19:41.766
but we knew nothing.

00:19:42.466 --> 00:19:46.696
We had no idea that Nene was producing
such fearsome weapons.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.370
We were reduced to entities

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.230
that only tell of the sadness that
Nene had spread throughout the world.

00:19:53.666 --> 00:19:55.566
That is why Homeron died.

00:19:55.966 --> 00:19:59.466
Because living as a master informant
had lost its meaning in this world.

00:20:00.233 --> 00:20:01.273
I doubt that.

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:04.503
No matter how much information
a master informant may collect,

00:20:04.533 --> 00:20:06.403
it's just information after all.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:09.800
Without a person who can
put it to good use,

00:20:09.833 --> 00:20:11.903
it's all just a waste of
time and effort, isn't it?

00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:15.373
I wonder if you would
be able to use

00:20:16.466 --> 00:20:17.996
the information
we gather more effectively....

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.600
We are searching
for the Extra Seven.

00:20:25.666 --> 00:20:26.696
Hey, Shu!

00:20:26.833 --> 00:20:28.833
So that we can become stronger.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.000
The Extra Seven only exist in the original
Book of the Beginning that was in Jibral.

00:20:34.533 --> 00:20:37.603
When Jibral disappeared,
the book was lost forever.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:40.300
It was stolen before that.

00:20:41.533 --> 00:20:45.103
The woman we are searching for
was involved in that incident.

00:20:46.233 --> 00:20:47.933
This is incredible information.

00:20:48.566 --> 00:20:50.326
Can you find that woman?

00:20:51.666 --> 00:20:53.966
If you are the legendary
Shadow Wielders...

00:20:54.866 --> 00:20:56.726
and if that is your wish...

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.400
Huh? What?
What do you mean?

00:21:00.333 --> 00:21:01.773
Why are you asking her?

00:21:02.066 --> 00:21:04.126
"Homeron did not want to die."

00:21:04.666 --> 00:21:06.926
That is a strange thing to have
inscribed on your grave.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.730
Nobody wants to die.

00:21:10.266 --> 00:21:12.126
So then, perhaps he meant
just the opposite.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:16.570
In other words, Homeron did
want to die, but he was unable to.

00:21:17.466 --> 00:21:19.596
Does that mean that Homeron
is still alive?

00:21:20.466 --> 00:21:21.896
This one here is Homeron.

00:21:22.233 --> 00:21:22.903
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:21:23.733 --> 00:21:26.333
She knows the most about Homeron,

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.400
and this is just my guess, but...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.270
You're right...

00:21:39.033 --> 00:21:43.103
Truth is always hiding right
beside the person who seeks it.

00:21:46.033 --> 00:21:48.733
You will make good use
of my information, won't you?

00:21:50.066 --> 00:21:51.726
I swear on my sword.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.370
Then leave the search for
that woman up to me.

00:21:56.066 --> 00:21:59.426
We intend to visit the ruins
of the Shadows next.

00:22:00.266 --> 00:22:02.496
We believe it's likely they have
some deep connection

00:22:02.533 --> 00:22:04.003
to the mystery of the Extra Seven.

00:22:05.066 --> 00:22:09.826
Well then, let us part ways here.
Nene's powers are growing.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.470
You should move with haste.

00:22:12.066 --> 00:22:14.696
I will get stronger too, Homeron.

00:22:15.233 --> 00:22:17.533
And one day, I will defeat Nene!

00:22:18.433 --> 00:22:19.103
Yes.

00:22:19.633 --> 00:22:20.633
Let's be on our way.

00:22:21.833 --> 00:22:23.573
Huh? Where's Marumaro?

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:25.930
Huh? Oh yeah... He's missing.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.230
Wasn't he with you guys?

00:22:28.666 --> 00:22:30.526
I think I saw him going
into the forest.

00:22:31.333 --> 00:22:33.833
We don't have that information.

00:22:34.266 --> 00:22:35.866
M-Marumaro...

00:22:36.666 --> 00:22:41.296
Maro... Where am I, maro...?

00:22:42.233 --> 00:22:44.703
Maro...

00:24:22.233 --> 00:24:23.633
At an inn run by a beautiful lady,

00:24:23.666 --> 00:24:25.226
Marumaro meets
a mysterious death.

00:24:25.366 --> 00:24:27.526
However you may try to
hide your crimes,

00:24:27.566 --> 00:24:30.526
they are laid bare before the skull
that hears the voices of the dead.

00:24:30.666 --> 00:24:33.026
People call me
the Bandanna Cop, Zola.

00:24:33.233 --> 00:24:35.003
And I'm her assistant, Bouquet.

00:24:35.033 --> 00:24:36.473
All of the mysteries have
now been solved.

00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:38.170
To be continued
in the full episode!

00:24:38.433 --> 00:24:40.703
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Dear Shadow"
